{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">追月夜，大坑上演今個中秋最後一場舞火龍。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大坑舞火龍來到最後一天。晚上八時許，全長67米，龍身點滿過萬支長壽香的火龍，穿梭大坑多條街道。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DRAGON-2230_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026hJX6y9fu7p1790436562.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.DRAGON-2230_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">約300名師傅依然落足力，與小火龍一同演出打龍餅，沿途繼續吸引不少市民及遊客在兩旁，舉高手機及相機「打卡」拍照。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在附近的維園，亦有不少人來追月、欣賞花燈。其中國際中秋綵燈匯的世界綵燈大街，因為人太多，連續第二晚十時截龍。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DRAGON-2230_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026wunmzp6uuo1790436574.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.DRAGON-2230_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-26T15:58:28.336252+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}